==Description==
The '''Vaporwave Nametag''' is an unreleased nametag. Based on its description, it was added to be part of the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]], though unlike the [[Bubbles Nametag]] it went completely unused.

The '''Vaporwave Nametag''' has purple text with a dark purple outline. A purple grid appears and moves beneath the text. A retrowave styled sunset can be seen in the top left corner of the text.

